completed_at: "2026-11-16T05:30:38.829Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: pm copy evaluates the workspace workflow policies with operation create and refuses a copy that create would refuse; The copy's history entry records the workflow_policies decisions like a create; A spec proves a refusing policy blocks both create and copy
parent: pm-33cw
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: low
resolution: "runCopy calls enforceWorkflowMutation with operation create before the guards, records workflow_policies in the copy's create history entry and returns policy warnings"
expected_result: "A copy that create would refuse is refused, and an accepted copy records its policy decisions"
actual_result: "Verified by write-path-guard-parity.spec.ts: an authors-only create policy refuses both create and copy by another agent with workflow_policy_refused and writes nothing; the allowed copy records the satisfied decision; fails on unmodified main"
